<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36861" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξαπλ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unfold, roll out,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρανὸν ὡς δέρριν ἐξαπλῶσαι</span> Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Philopatr.</u>
				17
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τὴν χεῖρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>M.</u>
					2.7
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶσαν τὴν ἔννοιαν εἰς τὰ πάντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be unfolded, spread out,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕπτιος ἐξήπλωτο νεκρὸν δέμας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Batr.
					106
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀϊδιότης -ωθεῖσα κατὰ τὴν
				χρονικὴν παράτασιν</span>
			<i>unrolled</i> successively, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				55
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unfold, explain,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφιβόλους λέξεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.302
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.
				<u>Eloc.</u>
				254
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				7.233
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> Medic.,
				<i>open out</i> a fistula, <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				44.23.50
			</span></i> (
				Pass.
			).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
